      "audioUrl": "audio/hornet_match_start_haze_hornet_convo02_01.mp3",
      "text": "How can you work for them?",
      "duration": 1.538
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Haze",
      "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_hornet_convo02_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_hornet_convo02_02.mp3",
      "text": "I love my country.",
      "duration": 1.99
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Vindicta",
      "audioFile": "hornet_match_start_haze_hornet_convo02_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/hornet_match_start_haze_hornet_convo02_03.mp3",
      "text": "I don't know why I'm bothering to reason with a zealot.",
      "duration": 2.608
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Haze",
      "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_hornet_convo02_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_hornet_convo02_04.mp3",
      "text": "I'm not a zealot.  The OSIC isn't perfect, and neither is the world.  You of all people should understand that the ends justify the means.",
      "duration": 9.494
    }
  ]
